flowchart TD
    A[Kick Chat Event] --> B[nexus-cortex Edge Function]
    B --> C{Generator Router}
    C -->|Fast Banter| D[Vyce: DeepSeek v4 Flash]
    C -->|Deep Lore| E[Vyce: Claude 4.6 Pro]
    
    D --> F[Reply to User]
    E --> F
    
    F --> G[EdgeRuntime.waitUntil Async Log]
    G --> H[(Supabase: nexus_stream_events)]
    
    H --> I[RSI Loop Triggers every 20 msgs]
    
    I --> J{Judge Router}
    J -->|If Gen was DeepSeek| K[Vyce: GLM-5.3 Free]
    J -->|If Gen was Claude| L[Groq: Qwen-3-32b]
    
    K --> M[JSON Evaluation & Diagnosis]
    L --> M
    
    M --> N[Propose Rule]
    N --> O[Simulated A/B Test vs Base Harness]
    O -->|Pass| P[(Supabase: nexus_persona_rules)]
    O -->|Fail| Q[Discard & Log Negative Result]